{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1486934-weapon-damage-types-question","id":1486934,"title":"Weapon Damage Types Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-18T19:37:31-07:00","id":1486934,"title":"Weapon Damage Types Question","content":"Hi, I'm learning the Storypath rules in preparation of running Aberrant for my gaming group. On p. 123 of the Trinity Continuum Core Rulebook, there is a list of 3 damage types: Ballistic, Edged, and Blunt. The book indicates that, &quot;The damage type determines what kind of injuries it can inflict.&quot; I don't understand what this means. Do the 3 damage types inflict different Injury Conditions (Bruised, Injured, Maimed)? If so, where is this described? Any guidance would be much appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25223-phdoom","name":"PhDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T20:58:00-07:00","id":1486950,"title":"","content":"Its just a descriptive thing. If you take &quot;blunt&quot; damage, describe it as bruises, concussions, or hairline fractures, &quot;edged&quot; damage inflicts cuts, and &quot;ballistic&quot; damage pierces into you.<br /> <br /> Going further into it, the terms you use to describe the injuries affect how they hamper the character. A bleeding scalp wound may hamper your vision for ranged attacks, but it won't stop you from running or punching, while a bullet to the foot makes it hard to move but doesn't prevent you from shooting back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","user":"Shepherdboi","date":". 07-20-2022, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T17:11:14-07:00","id":1487075,"title":"","content":"Thank you Shepherdoi! I really appreciate how helpful people are to a newbie like me on the boards <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25223-phdoom","name":"PhDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}